file tools/w/workload_trial_witness.rish the rung, recovered; header and say line re-ranged
file tools/fixtures/w/workload_trial_control.sh sed -i replaced by sed_inplace; the walled dialect a peer seated while this lap was parked
file construction/ITINERARY.md diffuser section replaced with row 12's account, the recovery named, row 11's shelved
file session-logs/date/20260915/20260915-222402_the-trial-with-nothing-to-compare.kyri the cut lap's own log, landed as written
scope one parked lap recovered whole and landed; one fresh timing reading swept across six surfaces
status GREEN -- workload_trial green on metal after restore, after the dialect repair and after the rebase, 62 legs, control_failed=0; shell_dialect, shell_dialect_touch, log_has_a_row and session_roster_agree all GREEN again; paper A 94 and erratum page A 96 measured after the edits
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the cut send is the second diffuser lap to end in the box in two hours; whether a lap should land its commit before its account edits, rather than staging both and sending once, is a word rather than a lap.
